name: Responsive report export under real ledger contention
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART before
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 0 pending · TP: 0 · FP: 1 | report-ready
keys: Up Up Up
require-live-snap: 20 format sarif (1/6) | sarif-selection
keys: e
require-live-snap: 20 EXPORT DESTINATION | destination-editor
keys: C-u
type: .kuzushi/reports/responsive.sarif
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 format sarif (1/6) | saved-destination
expect: responsive.sarif
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART start wide
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 3 EXPORTING | exporting-120x36
keys: NPage Escape
require-live-snap: 3 REVIEW VIEW | composer-120x36
expect-echo-within: 300 λ120draft
live-snap: typing-120x36
expect: REVIEW VIEW
require-live-snap: 15 DONE | completed-120x36
expect: λ120draft
keys: C-u
submit: report
require-live-snap: 20 REPORT | return-120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART start rail
keys: Enter
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 3 EXPORTING | exporting-160x48
keys: NPage Escape
require-live-snap: 3 REVIEW VIEW | composer-160x48
expect-echo-within: 300 λ160draft
live-snap: typing-160x48
expect: REVIEW VIEW
require-live-snap: 15 DONE | completed-160x48
expect: λ160draft
keys: C-u
submit: report
require-live-snap: 20 REPORT | return-160x48
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART start tall
keys: Enter
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 3 EXPORTING | exporting-96x89
keys: NPage Escape
require-live-snap: 3 REVIEW VIEW | composer-96x89
expect-echo-within: 300 λ96draft
live-snap: typing-96x89
expect: REVIEW VIEW
require-live-snap: 15 DONE | completed-96x89
expect: λ96draft
keys: C-u
submit: report
require-live-snap: 20 REPORT | return-96x89
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART start medium
keys: Enter
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 3 EXPORTING | exporting-80x24
keys: NPage Escape
require-live-snap: 3 REVIEW VIEW | composer-80x24
expect-echo-within: 300 λ80draft
live-snap: typing-80x24
expect: REVIEW VIEW
require-live-snap: 15 DONE | completed-80x24
expect: λ80draft
keys: C-u
submit: report
require-live-snap: 20 REPORT | return-80x24
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART start narrow
keys: Enter
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 3 EXPORTING | exporting-60x20
keys: NPage Escape
require-live-snap: 3 REVIEW VIEW | composer-60x20
expect-echo-within: 300 λ60draft
live-snap: typing-60x20
expect: REVIEW VIEW
require-live-snap: 15 DONE | completed-60x20
expect: λ60draft
keys: C-u
submit: report
require-live-snap: 20 REPORT | return-60x20
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART start tiny
keys: Enter
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 3 EXPORTING | exporting-40x12
keys: NPage Escape
require-live-snap: 3 REVIEW VIEW | composer-40x12
expect-echo-within: 300 λ40draft
live-snap: typing-40x12
expect: REVIEW VIEW
require-live-snap: 15 DONE | completed-40x12
expect: λ40draft
expect: F-0001
ask: Across the six sizes, do progress, typing and resize remain usable during real ledger contention, and the returned workflow composer remains selected with its draft after export finishes?
keys: C-u
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART verify
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 5 committed / 7 calls | recovered-report
expect: responsive.sarif
expect-not: EXPORTING
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/report_responsiveness.py @TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does the no-color restart retain report choices and investigation accounting without inventing an active export or new work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
